Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.41,0:00:03.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}＜游马：看到春人痛苦的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.44,0:00:05.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗迷失了自己的决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.06,0:00:09.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们被{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}的战略逼入绝境＞
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.61,0:00:12.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}）上吧 魔界锁链！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.71,0:00:14.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无限加农炮！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.91,0:00:18.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}）结束了 快斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.84,0:00:20.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吃下3000点伤害吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.36,0:00:25.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动陷阱！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.86,0:00:26.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}勇敢之心！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.42,0:00:33.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}支付自己一半的生命值
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.76,0:00:37.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个回合使怪兽效果的发动无效！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.26,0:00:38.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（快斗）什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.11,0:00:46.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.53,0:00:49.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啧…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.98,0:00:52.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}区区一个附赠品还敢多管闲事。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.37,0:00:55.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}：又牺牲自己…》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.18,0:00:59.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没事吧？星光体。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.33,0:01:02.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵…没办法啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.77,0:01:04.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是你的决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.41,0:01:05.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我渐渐习惯了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.07,0:01:10.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙，为什么……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.95,0:01:12.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我说过了吧？要把哈鲁特
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.85,0:01:14.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}带到你那里去。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.08,0:01:16.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}多管闲事……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.56,0:01:20.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖下一张卡，回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.98,0:01:23.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的……对游马说句谢谢也可以吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.31,0:01:25.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（轨道7）请您原谅。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.91,0:01:27.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗大人也是拼了命……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.22,0:01:46.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你看。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.69,0:01:50.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好厉害啊，哥哥！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.35,0:01:53.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《托隆：这就是哈鲁特的记忆……》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.79,0:01:57.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好漂亮啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.28,0:02:02.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，好不容易才把他抓住的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.52,0:02:04.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}放他走也可以吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.33,0:02:05.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.11,0:02:08.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为，一辈子在笼子里度过一生
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.50,0:02:10.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也太可怜了。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.95,0:02:13.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈鲁特大人……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.54,0:02:16.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你真温柔啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.89,0:02:29.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要把你的记忆 全部夺走。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.02,0:04:11.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来 快点 抽卡吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.80,0:04:13.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼 别 这么催我啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.85,0:04:16.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的 好景色啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.92,0:04:18.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}！ 你……
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.22,0:04:20.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}确实 做得有点过分了吧……
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.20,0:04:22.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}做得过分？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.82,0:04:26.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你难道忘了我们尝过的痛苦吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.96,0:04:28.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哥哥大人……
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.66,0:04:31.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来 做你该做的事吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.66,0:04:35.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.36,0:04:37.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动 永续魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.45,0:04:40.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}古代遗物·金字塔·眼·石板！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.26,0:04:44.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以让 自己场上的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.11,0:04:45.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}古代遗物怪兽的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.10,0:04:47.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}提升８００点。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.23,0:04:52.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}马修·麦克的怪兽效果 发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.29,0:04:56.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在怪兽的攻击力发生变化时
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.74,0:04:58.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用一个叠放单位
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.16,0:05:01.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将那个数值给予敌人伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.07,0:05:04.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 马修·麦克！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.17,0:05:06.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无限加农炮！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.71,0:05:13.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}）这样一来你剩下的生命值也岌岌可危了。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.36,0:05:17.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接下来 轮到你了…… 快斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.90,0:05:19.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}）动手吧 {\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.50,0:05:23.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}马修·麦克！ 攻击银河眼！！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.14,0:05:24.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}弗利尔之火！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.60,0:05:36.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}由于巨石阵护盾的效果
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.74,0:05:39.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼的攻击力变为 ０。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.38,0:05:42.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到此为止了 快斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.94,0:05:43.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.48,0:05:48.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（快斗）陷阱发动 战斗模拟！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.69,0:05:52.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡会让战斗双方的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.06,0:05:54.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽攻击力减半{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.79,0:05:57.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且还能保护怪兽不被战斗破坏。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.24,0:06:03.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，战斗伤害你还是要吃下的！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.85,0:06:06.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.73,0:06:11.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.42,0:06:17.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗，你没事吧，喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.05,0:06:19.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.32,0:06:20.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还没完。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.88,0:06:23.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的生命值还没归零呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.63,0:06:26.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼，无谓的垂死挣扎。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.39,0:06:30.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}乖乖地跟你弟弟一起掉进地狱去吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.57,0:06:33.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔，你这家伙……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.70,0:06:35.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗，冷静点！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.08,0:06:36.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}闭嘴！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.17,0:06:42.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你对我所承受的痛苦对我的憎恨又了解什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.58,0:06:49.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是啊，你不懂，你根本不懂！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.17,0:06:52.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你还有遥人的憎恨与悲伤，你都不懂。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.04,0:06:55.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 我跟你决斗过了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.80,0:06:58.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过决斗我认识了你！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.15,0:07:03.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗会带来新的伙伴会结下羁绊。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.67,0:07:07.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且 决斗这东西会让人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.51,0:07:09.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天成为全新的自己！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.57,0:07:13.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}绝对不是用来发泄怨恨和憎恶的工具！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.77,0:07:16.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让你见识一下 我的一飞冲天！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.00,0:07:19.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这一抽 赌上一切。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.89,0:07:20.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.88,0:07:24.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦。我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.02,0:07:30.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来了。我发动魔法卡死者苏生。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.24,0:07:33.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}复活吧 希望皇霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.63,0:07:37.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让 No.怪兽复活了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.31,0:07:37.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啧。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.38,0:07:40.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普的力量可不止这么点。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.74,0:07:42.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是 一飞冲天！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.31,0:07:45.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（2人）混沌超量变身！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.32,0:07:50.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（2人）现身吧 CNo.39。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.21,0:07:55.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（2人）希望皇 霍普雷！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.19,0:08:07.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.28,0:08:09.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}CNo.？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.33,0:08:12.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这 No.是怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.66,0:08:17.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个少年 九十九游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.15,0:08:19.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}九十九……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.58,0:08:23.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道说……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.17,0:08:28.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是游马的希望之光。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.64,0:08:31.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看到了吗 霍普真正的姿态。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.52,0:08:34.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从没见过这样的 No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.78,0:08:42.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没想到 附赠品里居然有这种卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.19,0:08:45.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动霍普雷的怪兽效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.46,0:08:48.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过消耗一个超量素材{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.81,0:08:51.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个回合攻击力提升500点！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.62,0:08:55.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量充能！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.40,0:09:00.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 马修·麦克已经
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.11,0:09:02.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把超量素材用完了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.11,0:09:05.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 还留有超量素材
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.36,0:09:06.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}巨人杀手{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.12,0:09:09.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下个回合 要是发动效果的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.90,0:09:11.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们就完了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.25,0:09:12.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我知道。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.44,0:09:16.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 这个效果会让对方1只怪兽的攻击力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.56,0:09:18.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下降1000点！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.80,0:09:20.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 选择巨人杀手。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.58,0:09:23.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 霍普雷！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.89,0:09:26.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普剑 混沌斩！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.08,0:09:44.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}IV的生命值是 2400。 这一击…。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.71,0:09:46.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}打倒IV了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.81,0:09:49.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}成功了！ 成功了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.35,0:09:52.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.88,0:09:59.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}永续陷阱 机关箱。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.73,0:10:00.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.19,0:10:04.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡 在玩家受到
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.11,0:10:05.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}战斗伤害时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.32,0:10:07.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将其无效
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.36,0:10:10.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并变成怪兽卡特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.68,0:10:13.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后，被无效化的战斗伤害数值
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.35,0:10:15.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会成为这张卡的攻击力。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.52,0:10:18.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会…连霍普雷都无法解决掉吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.32,0:10:21.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道看穿了我们的攻击吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.62,0:10:23.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.21,0:10:26.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖放一张卡，回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.06,0:10:30.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后，霍普雷的攻击力恢复原状。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.71,0:10:34.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就凭你，能打倒我你是认真的吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.00,0:10:38.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让你见识一下什么叫做真正的绝望！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.51,0:10:40.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.05,0:10:44.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动魔法卡，废品人偶！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.43,0:10:46.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以将墓地里的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.92,0:10:49.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力1000以下的机关傀儡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.58,0:10:51.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以守备表示特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.44,0:10:55.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}复活吧！机关傀儡·死灵人偶！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.67,0:11:10.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将等级8的机关盒和
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.91,0:11:12.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}死灵人偶叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.06,0:11:15.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用两只暗属性怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.99,0:11:18.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建超量网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.68,0:11:19.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.69,0:11:24.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧！No.40！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.55,0:11:36.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}机关傀儡 天堂弦乐手！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.59,0:11:39.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.86,0:11:43.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不会吧 都到这一步了攻击力3000的 No.怪兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.67,0:11:45.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}粉丝福利也差不多该结束了。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.46,0:11:50.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗 你先一步给我下地狱去吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.03,0:11:55.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}天堂弦乐手！攻击银河眼！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.77,0:11:57.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}天堂之弦！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.12,0:12:02.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《这样下去的话 快斗他！？》
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.33,0:12:04.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《春人…》
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.22,0:12:09.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这次真的结束了！快斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.11,0:12:16.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动陷阱卡！陷阱重生！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.73,0:12:20.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡 将自己的生命值唔… 减半{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.01,0:12:23.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对方墓地里的通过除外陷阱卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.82,0:12:25.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}获得那个能力！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.79,0:12:28.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要选的是 战斗模拟！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.58,0:12:31.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}战斗模拟是
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.92,0:12:33.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在怪兽进行战斗时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.28,0:12:37.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将双方怪兽的攻击力减半
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.12,0:12:39.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并使怪兽的破坏无效！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.43,0:12:53.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗大人！？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.94,0:13:00.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}又来了… 别开玩笑了 你们这帮家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.33,0:13:04.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}差不多该给我沉下去！ 沉啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.12,0:13:10.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《游马 你又是削减自己的生命值…》
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.69,0:13:13.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《唔… 饶不了你们。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.54,0:13:16.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}竟敢浪费我的粉丝福利》
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.19,0:13:19.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们这帮家伙我饶不了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.12,0:13:22.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动天堂弦乐的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.44,0:13:25.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡 1回合1次
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.19,0:13:27.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用1个超量素材{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.50,0:13:29.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在下个回合结束时将场上的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.95,0:13:31.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所有怪兽全部破坏！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.72,0:13:35.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 将破坏掉的怪兽的攻击力数值{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.30,0:13:38.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}作为伤害给予玩家！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.21,0:13:40.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.36,0:13:46.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（IV）看好了！这就是
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.08,0:13:48.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唯有神才能操纵的 命运之线。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.66,0:14:07.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 就是真正的终结了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.37,0:14:10.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 轮到你们了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.29,0:14:13.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 下一个快斗的回合
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.72,0:14:15.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要不打倒他们两个人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.27,0:14:17.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们就没有胜算。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.55,0:14:22.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.28,0:14:28.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵呵…… 怎么了已经精疲力尽了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.81,0:14:31.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连站都站不起来的话就是我们赢了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.69,0:14:35.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.67,0:14:43.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}站起来！站起来啊 快斗！！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.64,0:14:46.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就这样输了也无所谓吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.64,0:14:48.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}站起来！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.55,0:14:50.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么 你不站起来啊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.66,0:14:53.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.94,0:14:57.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.49,0:14:59.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}站起来 快斗！ 站起来啊！！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.99,0:15:00.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.82,0:15:02.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}站起来 去战斗啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.64,0:15:04.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗大人 请您站起来！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.39,0:15:07.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}遍体鳞伤也没关系。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.16,0:15:08.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不要放弃到最后啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.25,0:15:12.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你要是放弃了 那怎么行啊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.24,0:15:15.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你如果不保护小春
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.59,0:15:20.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那谁来保护小春啊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.13,0:15:22.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小春…。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.20,0:15:24.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《我又 再一次 把你…》
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.04,0:15:29.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哥哥…。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.77,0:15:32.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哥哥！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.34,0:15:32.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小春！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.15,0:15:35.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小春！！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.30,0:15:41.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（心园先生）快斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.32,0:15:44.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}想见到哈鲁特的话
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.81,0:15:46.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你也只能
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.22,0:15:48.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为Dr.费克大人效力了。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.07,0:15:51.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你会协助我的吧？快斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.71,0:15:56.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这混蛋！！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.24,0:16:22.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.07,0:16:25.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}绝对会保护好你…。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.39,0:16:32.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈鲁特！！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.01,0:16:39.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们兄弟俩 所有的记忆我就收下了。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.58,0:16:41.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（哈鲁特）我不会让你得逞的。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.92,0:16:45.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谁也别想夺走我和哥哥的回忆。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.17,0:16:48.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈鲁特！你怎么会在这里？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.50,0:16:54.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么回事！？发生了什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.64,0:16:57.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这种人 根本不会明白。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.71,0:17:00.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哥哥他有多么拼命地保护我。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.90,0:17:03.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有多么拼命地护着我。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.29,0:17:08.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这次 换我来保护哥哥！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.50,0:17:18.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什…什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.58,0:17:20.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.63,0:17:30.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.78,0:17:32.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.40,0:17:40.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发生了什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.80,0:17:49.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会…？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.76,0:17:52.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}遥的力量消失了…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.85,0:17:54.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}遥…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.56,0:17:57.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是你给我的啊 这份力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.09,0:18:09.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}此刻 全新的力量 寄宿在了快斗的卡组中。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.47,0:18:12.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全新的力量！？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.90,0:18:16.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他们兄弟的羁绊引发了奇迹。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.44,0:18:18.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.35,0:18:22.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合… 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.52,0:18:25.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼攻击力是０！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.39,0:18:28.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的生命值 仅仅１００！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.93,0:18:32.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}垂死挣扎的家伙还能做什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.49,0:18:34.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}垂死挣扎的是你们！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.51,0:18:41.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌发动 魔法卡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.47,0:18:43.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动超量再生！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.06,0:18:49.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡能让场上的所有怪兽超量{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.64,0:18:51.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}恢复一个超量素材。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.29,0:19:03.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体，你在那里吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.34,0:19:08.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你以前说过我和游马很像。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.99,0:19:10.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就跟我共鸣吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.56,0:19:14.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！用我们的怪兽去救快斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.96,0:19:16.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.07,0:19:19.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗，用我的怪兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.75,0:19:20.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.99,0:19:26.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将希望皇霍普雷和伤害法师解放
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.94,0:19:29.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}高等召唤光子凯撒！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.80,0:19:33.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}光子凯撒在用于超量召唤时
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.26,0:19:34.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以当作2只来使用。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.54,0:19:38.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将等级8的银河眼和{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.27,0:19:42.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当作2只的光子凯撒叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.31,0:19:48.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用3只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.42,0:19:50.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建超量网络。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.46,0:19:52.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.23,0:19:54.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}汹涌翻腾的银河啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.19,0:20:00.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}此刻 化作怒涛之光现身吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.64,0:20:08.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}降临吧 我的灵魂！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.90,0:20:27.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}新银河眼光子龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.95,0:20:31.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼进化了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.58,0:20:40.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是 我所感受到的快斗全新的力量……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.38,0:20:40.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.78,0:20:43.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动新银河眼的怪兽效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.09,0:20:46.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}光子咆哮！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.17,0:20:51.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}新银河眼
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.49,0:20:53.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在使用银河眼召唤时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.05,0:20:56.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将自身以外的怪兽效果无效化。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.46,0:20:57.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.78,0:21:00.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不用超量素材
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.73,0:21:02.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也能发动效果吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.56,0:21:06.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}新银河眼 第二效果 发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.09,0:21:09.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过使用一个超量素材{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.34,0:21:12.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吸收场上的所有超量素材！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.20,0:21:17.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个回合 攻击力按吸收的超量素材每有一个{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.15,0:21:20.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}提升500点 并且可以攻击那个次数。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.34,0:21:22.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力6000！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.03,0:21:24.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且 还能连续攻击！？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.79,0:21:27.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}新银河眼光子龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.12,0:21:30.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}终极光子流！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.26,0:21:47.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.30,0:21:52.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}IV！ 做好忏悔的准备了吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.72,0:21:57.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}终极光子流！
